#: ../../source/docs/manual-mode.rst:5 010e6702fae54b069cb9f585914e1e62
msgid "Manual mode"
msgstr "Manual 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-mode.rst:7 43e7df5589a541ff8c0a671da4b94642
msgid ""
"In Manual mode, the transmitter's steering and throttle sticks directly "
"control the vehicle's throttle and steering output."
msgstr "在 Manual 模式下，遥控器的转向摇杆和油门摇杆直接控制车辆的油门和转向输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-mode.rst:9 3cd710c272d045a2b2b95df302d6f92b
msgid ""
"This mode does not require a position estimate (i.e. GPS is not required)."
msgstr "此模式不需要位置估计（即不需要 GPS）。"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-mode.rst:10 db3cb375cf194c749c75e2b21b8aeaf1
msgid ""
"It is recommended to always have one :ref:`transmitter mode switch <common-"
"rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration>` position assigned to this mode."
msgstr ""
"建议始终将一个 :ref:`遥控器模式开关 <common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration>` "
"位置分配给此模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-mode.rst:11 c62f7c02606747238e642ff1528430d8
msgid ""
"The throttle slew still applies. See the bottom of the :ref:`Tuning Speed "
"and Throttle <rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed>` page for more details about "
"the throttle slew limit."
msgstr ""
"油门斜率限制仍然有效。有关油门斜率限制的更多详情，请参见 :ref:`速度与油门调参 <rover-tuning-throttle-and-"
"speed>` 页面底部。"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-mode.rst:12 5de908c8e4c1470dba04c3c3ef45ff35
msgid ""
"Steering angle speed scaling can be enabled via the first bit of "
":ref:`MANUAL_OPTIONS<MANUAL_OPTIONS>`. This requires a ground speed estimate"
" from one of many types of sensors."
msgstr ""
"可通过 :ref:`MANUAL_OPTIONS<MANUAL_OPTIONS>` "
"的第一位启用转向角速度缩放功能。该功能需要从多种传感器之一获取地面速度估计值。"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-mode.rst:13 f8f69adcc1fd44b5bb2531390abafb74
msgid ""
"Steering expo can be applied using :ref:`MANUAL_STR_EXPO<MANUAL_STR_EXPO>` "
"to decrease transmitter steering control sensitivity around neutral."
msgstr ""
"可使用 :ref:`MANUAL_STR_EXPO<MANUAL_STR_EXPO>` 应用转向曲线，以降低遥控器转向控制在中立区附近的灵敏度。"
